A watcher dropped for falling behind is restarted by the supervisor,
and restarting from 0 every time would re-read the whole log on each
cycle — worst on exactly the busy sessions that cause the drop. It
resumes here instead.rust-analyzer cargo teleportd 0.1.0 anchor_watch/impl#[Derived]idle_since_ms().idle_since_mspub fn idle_since_ms(&self, now_ms: i64) -> Option<i64>When this session went quiet, or `None` if it is not idle yet.

