Four fields teleport's API serves have no anchor equivalent, by
decision — `title`, `claude_resume_id`, `last_bell_ms`, `idle_since_ms`.
Anchor's scope doc keeps them in clients because each is a policy about
what a UI shows, and a second anchor client would want different ones.

On the in-process path the PTY reader scans every byte as it passes,
whether or not anyone is watching. Over a socket teleport only sees
bytes while it is attached — so to keep the fields truthful for a
session nobody has open, teleport attaches to every session it owns and
scans the stream itself. That is one observer connection per session,
which is cheap: anchor is already producing those bytes for its log, and
an observer never takes the lease or writes.pub mod anchor_watchlocal src/anchor_watch.rs 0self: &Derivedlocal src/anchor_watch.rs 1now_ms: i64local src/anchor_watch.rs 2self: &WatchRegistrylocal src/anchor_watch.rs 3local src/anchor_watch.rs 4local src/anchor_watch.rs 5local src/anchor_watch.rs 6local src/anchor_watch.rs 7local src/anchor_watch.rs 8f: impl FnOnce(&mut Derived)local src/anchor_watch.rs 9let mut sessions: MutexGuard<'_, RawMutex, HashMap<String, Derived>>local src/anchor_watch.rs 10anchoranchor: AnchorClientlocal src/anchor_watch.rs 11registry: Arc<WatchRegistry>local src/anchor_watch.rs 12owner: Stringlocal src/anchor_watch.rs 13anchor: &AnchorClientlocal src/anchor_watch.rs 14registry: &Arc<WatchRegistry>local src/anchor_watch.rs 15local src/anchor_watch.rs 16let sessions: Vec<AnchorSession>local src/anchor_watch.rs 19let session: AnchorSessionlocal src/anchor_watch.rs 20freshlet fresh: boollocal src/anchor_watch.rs 22local src/anchor_watch.rs 23local src/anchor_watch.rs 24id: Stringlocal src/anchor_watch.rs 25let from: u64local src/anchor_watch.rs 26dd: Derivedlocal src/anchor_watch.rs 27let mut attach: AnchorAttachlocal src/anchor_watch.rs 28d: &mut Derivedlocal src/anchor_watch.rs 29scannerlet mut scanner: OscScannerlocal src/anchor_watch.rs 30local src/anchor_watch.rs 31local src/anchor_watch.rs 32nowlet now: i64local src/anchor_watch.rs 33endlet end: u64local src/anchor_watch.rs 34local src/anchor_watch.rs 35let update: OscUpdatelocal src/anchor_watch.rs 36local src/anchor_watch.rs 37let title: Stringlocal src/anchor_watch.rs 38resumelet resume: Stringlocal src/anchor_watch.rs 39rust-analyzer cargo core https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/library/core time/impl#[Duration]from_secs().rust-analyzer cargo core https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/library/core ops/arith/impl#[i64][`Sub<Self>`]sub().rust-analyzer cargo core https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/library/core cmp/impls/impl#[i64][`PartialOrd<Self>`]ge().rust-analyzer cargo core https://github