returns it, `auth.rs` is what understands it.pub label: StringUser-editable display name, defaulted from the user agent at
enrollment. Cosmetic.When this credential was enrolled.pub last_used_ms: Option<i64>Last successful assertion, or `None` if it has never been used since
enrollment. Drives the settings list only.AuthSessionRowpub struct AuthSessionRowA live login session. The token that addresses this row is **not** a
field: only its hash is stored (see the module header).ULID, and the `token_id` carried in `Principal::DeviceToken`
(docs/12-identity-and-connectivity.md#the-principal).pub passkey_id: StringThe credential that minted this session. `ON DELETE CASCADE`, so
