next tick rather than kept alive by the syncer.rust-analyzer cargo teleportd 0.1.0 log/LogSyncer#tx.tx: Option<Sender<(Weak<File>, PathBuf)>>rust-analyzer cargo teleportd 0.1.0 log/LogSyncer#thread.threadthread: Option<JoinHandle<()>>rust-analyzer cargo teleportd 0.1.0 log/impl#[LogSyncer]new().pub fn new(interval: Duration) -> SelfStarts the syncer thread, flushing every registered log every
