Teleport's clients keep speaking teleport's protocol
(docs/04-api-protocol.md); this translates it onto anchor's attach
stream. A deliberately separate path from `ws::run`: that loop is the
authoritative one while the extraction is in flight, and threading an
`Option<Session>` through it would put the risk in the code that
currently works rather than in the code that is new.

Two leases are in play and they are not the same thing. Teleport's
(`anchor_lease`) decides which *browser* may type, and carries the
disconnect grace a reconnecting client depends on. Anchor's decides
which *connection to anchord* may write, and this connection claims it
whenever it wins teleport's.local src/ws_anchor.rs 0proxyproxy: Proxylocal src/ws_anchor.rs 1let mut socket: WebSocketlocal src/ws_anchor.rs 2local src/ws_anchor.rs 3local src/ws_anchor.rs 4let session_id: Stringlocal src/ws_anchor.rs 5local src/ws_anchor.rs 6local src/ws_anchor.rs 7local src/ws_anchor.rs 8let after: Option<u64>local src/ws_anchor.rs 9let tail: Option<u64>local src/ws_anchor.rs 10local src/ws_anchor.rs 11local src/ws_anchor.rs 12local src/ws_anchor.rs 14local src/ws_anchor.rs 15local src/ws_anchor.rs 16local src/ws_anchor.rs 17local src/ws_anchor.rs 18local src/ws_anchor.rs 19let mut control_epoch: Option<u64>local src/ws_anchor.rs 20local src/ws_anchor.rs 21let attach: AnchorAttachlocal src/ws_anchor.rs 22local src/ws_anchor.rs 23local src/ws_anchor.rs 24delivered_tolet mut delivered_to: u64local src/ws_anchor.rs 25lease_eventslet mut lease_events: Receiver<SessionEvent>local src/ws_anchor.rs 26local src/ws_anchor.rs 27local src/ws_anchor.rs 28let frame: Result<Option<AnchorFrame>, Error>local src/ws_anchor.rs 29local src/ws_anchor.rs 30local src/ws_anchor.rs 31let code: Option<i32>local src/ws_anchor.rs 32let held: boollocal src/ws_anchor.rs 33local src/ws_anchor.rs 34local src/ws_anchor.rs 35local src/ws_anchor.rs 36local src/ws_anchor.rs 37local src/ws_anchor.rs 38local src/ws_anchor.rs 39local src/ws_anchor.rs 40local src/ws_anchor.rs 41let message: Option<Result<Message, Error>>local src/ws_anchor.rs 42local src/ws_anchor.rs 43allowedlet allowed: boollocal src/ws_anchor.rs 44local src/ws_anchor.rs 45local src/ws_anchor.rs 46local src/ws_anchor.rs 47local src/ws_anchor.rs 48leases: &Arc<LeaseRegistry>local src/ws_anchor.rs 49attach: &mut AnchorAttachlocal src/ws_anchor.rs 50session_id: &strlocal src/ws_anchor.rs 51local src/ws_anchor.rs 52local src/ws_anchor.rs 53control_epoch: &mut Option<u64>local src/ws_anchor.rs 54local src/ws_anchor.rs 55local src/ws_anchor.rs 57local src/ws_anchor.rs 58local src/ws_anchor.rs 60local src/ws_anchor.rs 61loc