a green run for tests that never executed is worse than no tests.local tests/anchor_http.rs Anchord#Anchordstruct Anchordlocal tests/anchor_http.rs Anchord#child.local tests/anchor_http.rs Anchord#dir.local tests/anchor_http.rs Anchord#start().rust-analyzer cargo teleportd 0.1.0 impl#[Anchord]restart().restartfn restart(&mut self)Stops and starts anchord **keeping its data directory**, which is
what makes this a restart rather than a fresh daemon: the store
